<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.26, 0.26 and 0.31 percentage points respectively at Wednesday's auction, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     1,546		 812	  12.40 (12.66)</p>
<p>    6 months     1,800		 884	  13.61 (13.87)</p>
<p>    12 months    1,081		 503	  13.92 (14.23)</p>
<p>    Total	  4,427	     2,199</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent, previous week's yields in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
